Package: cix-ffmpeg
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: CIX FFmpeg command-line multimedia tools
 This package provides the CIX-optimized ffmpeg and ffprobe tools. They use
 the private CIX multimedia libraries and hardware acceleration interfaces.

